  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced TCP and UDP listeners with async event-driven connection handling.\n\t\t\t- Added Connection hub and transmission extensions with high-throughput batching.\n\t\t\t- Implemented middleware pipeline supporting inbound/outbound interceptors.\n\t\t\t- Added Protocol subsystem for lifecycle, metrics, and public RPC methods.\n\t\t\t- Introduced adaptive throttling: ConnectionLimiter, TokenBucketLimiter, and PolicyRateLimiter.\n\t\t\t- Added Timing subsystem with high-resolution TimingWheel and TimeSynchronizer.\n\t\t\t- Enhanced internal abstractions for extensibility and concurrent dispatch safety.\n\t\t\t- Major refactors for performance, stability, and maintainability across all layers.",
